          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#d30000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>QC Retention of QC Cross Sells: 6M post-trial</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Filtering only cross selled users from Jan&apos;22 to Jun&apos;23 that have been acquired at least 6 months before they tried QC.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>For simplicity: QC = Dmarts + Shops</run>
          </formatted-text>
